       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Aim Assist option has been added.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With the Aim Assist option toggled, the reticle with snap to the Clay Block as soon as it touches it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Aim Assist option can be handy when playing with a controller or on Steam Deck.",
